  "body": "## What changed\n`probe_op::every_older_kind_keeps_its_stored_id_and_digest_tag` asserted `PROJECT_VERSION == 51`, so it has been red on `main` since #329's v52 rung (and #326 / PR #341's v53 would break it again). The line is dropped; the kind id / digest-tag loop above it stays the pin - that loop is what proves adding the Probe kind needed no format rung.\n\n## Readings\n- Before (main e8a7f59): `left: 52, right: 51`.\n- After: `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test probe_op` - 11 passed, 0 failed.\n\n## Pinning test\n`probe_op::every_older_kind_keeps_its_stored_id_and_digest_tag` (still asserts every older kind's id and tag).\n\nDecision: `docs/decisions/344-probe-version-pin.md`.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #344\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
